Z||000000||mshill||08-06-2000||03:47 PM||||Is there supposed tobe some sort of washer between the top of the balljoint boot and the steering knuckle?<P>I have new front upper and lower balljoints, but it doesn't look like the kits included a washer like the steering knuckle has.||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||08-06-2000||03:55 PM||||I've never seen washers used on top of ball joint or tie rod end boots. If you do put one there make sure it in no way obstrucks seating of the joint into it's tapered hole.||||reg||1
Z||000002||mshill||08-06-2000||06:26 PM||||Thanks, Ogre.  The thing that I saw on the tie rod end must be part of the boot.<P>||||reg||1
